e watched from a small window. Time spent in those windows counts toward today's usage.\n- Quick focus: start a focus session from the home screen with one tap. Pick 25, 45, 60 or 90 minutes, 2 hours, or a custom length from 15 minutes to 12 hours. By default only your focus whitelist stays open, or you can lock only the apps you choose. Ending early needs the cooldown or an unlock code.\n- Open limit and pause before opening: set how many times a day an app can be opened, and make it wait 5 to 30 seconds before it opens, optionally 5 seconds longer with each open, up to 60 seconds. Once the opens are used up, an extra open needs the cooldown or an unlock code.\n- This update is for Android only. The iPhone version stays at v0.1.5, and these new features are Android only for now.\n\nversionCode: 23\nsha256: 1734129fa4ac7aa56560ca7276c2e94344f032e29ad8851fb280aa5d3bf44df5\n", "version": "0.1.8", "versionCode": 23, "apkSizeBytes": 9149413, "sha256": "1734129fa4ac7aa56560ca7276c2e94344f032e29ad8851fb280aa5d3bf44df5", "ipaSizeBytes": 7764400, "ipaSha256": "3b7fca162f27b7033e45fe762f59587214bb7cb2c9cd1f4dcf047afb4f472f0f", "iosVersion": "0.1.5", "downloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.8.apk", "iosDownloadUrl": "https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "mirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.8.apk", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.8/ripple-v0.1.8.apk", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.8/ripple-v0.1.8.apk", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/releases/download/v0.1.8/ripple-v0.1.8.apk"], "iosMirrors": ["https://ripplefocus.github.io/dl/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://gh-proxy.com/https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/ripplefocus/ripplefocus.github.io/releases/download/v0.1.5/ripple-v0.1.5.ipa", "https://github.com/tumingke0/ripple/release